{"c":"421037","n":"LUŽNICE 6","t":"M","s":"JČ","o":"Soběslav","url":"421037-luznice-6","stav":"2026-10-03","popis":"Přítok Vltavy. Od mlýna v Roudné až k jezu v Dráchově, včetně části Dírenského potoka ke kamennému mostu v k. ú. Chlebov (GPS 49°14'35.114\"N, 14°43'44.868\"E).\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nK revíru patří nádrže:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nRoudná I\tv k. ú. Roudná\t4 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n(GPS 49°18'2.493\"N, 14°42'25.135\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nRoudná II\tKlenovice\t4 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n(GPS 49°18'0.306\"N, 14°42'5.935\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nKarvánky\tDráchov\t1,5 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n(GPS 49°13'50.56\"N, 14°43'12.872\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nNadýmač\tSoběslav\t3,5 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n(GPS 49°14'36.181\"N, 14°43'44.22\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nNa řece je lov ryb z plavidel povolen. Zákaz používání streamerů v období od 1. 1. do 15. 6.","delka":13,"rozloha":101,"lat":49.266889,"lon":14.7166,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/sobeslav","mo_tel":"","mo_mail":"sobeslav@mo.jcus.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":